  "editorial": {
    "name": "Number Badge · NL Design System",
    "descriptionZh": "NL Design System 里 Number Badge 组件的规范页，讲的是那个用来提示数量的角标。一页给出 Figma 库、Storybook、三个 npm 包和无障碍清单。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿 Number Badge 的无障碍清单和 npm 包。",
    "noteZh": "面包屑是 Home > Componenten > Number Badge，荷兰语定义 Toont een klein label dat de aandacht trekt en informeert over een aantal.，别名写 Counter Badge、Notificatie en Aantal。左栏铺着整站近百个组件的长清单，从 Accordion、Action Group、Alert、Alert Dialog、Avatar 一路排到 Button、Calendar、Card as Link、Case Card、Checkbox Group。卡片区列出 Figma - Start bibliotheek / Figma - Voorbeeld bibliotheek、Storybook - CSS / - React，以及 @nl-design-system-candidate/number-badge-css、-react、-tokens；右栏目录最短，Checklist voor toegankelijkheid 之后直接就是 CSS、React、Design tokens、Definition of Done。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
